window.products.push({"id":826236,"name":"PHIWILLS 80W Electric Lunch Box Food Heater, 3 in 1 Portable Food Warmer 12V/24V/110V for Car Truck Home Food Heating, 1.5L Removable Stainless Steel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wmfuyvBBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【80W High-Power Fast Heating】It adopts 80W high power PTC & 0.66mm thickness of thermally conductive aluminum plate that usually only takes about 15~25 minutes to heating food and ultimately holding temperature about 50°C which is much faster than the 40W version. Moreover, using low-consumption heat cycle to keep food at a suitable temperature and keep the moisture of the food. 【3 in 1 Portable Microwave Box】It has 2 types of power cables, 110V/230V home & office use cable and 12V/24V car & truck use cable. Once plug it in, it begins to heat up your meal or keep your meal warm. Comfortable handle design made it easy to carry and it's very convient for car drivers, truckers, students, office employees, staffs, construction workers, outdoor picnic etc. 【2 Container Included & Easy to Clean】It includes a 1.5L 304 stainless steel container and a 0.45L dish box for fruit or vegetable, both of them are removable and suitable for hand wash or dishwasher, you can take them out and clean it very easily. Note: Do not wash the heating base with water and do not add water to the heating base, in order to avoid a short circuit. 【Food Grade Material & Leak-proof 】The shell of lunch box is made of premium food grade PP plastic which is high temperature resistant, durable and meets the safety standard of dietary materials. The lunch box's lid and the silicone sealing ring is totally leak-proof design can prevent liquid from overflowing or leaking when you are holding it or driving a car. 【Gifted with a Portable Insulated Bag】Equipped with a lunch bag is sturdy, durable, lightweight, foldable and easy to carry. Lined with insulated non-toxic aluminum foil can keep the food fresh and warm for hours, it's perfect to pack your electric lunch box and your food, Wherever you're going, take this lunch bag, you can enjoy warm and healthy meal anytime, anywhere. 【Package Includes & Warranty】Package includes 1x electric lunch box, 1x 1.5L 304 stainless steel container, 1x 0.45L plastic compartment, 1x Insulated Bag, 1x 304 stainless steel spoon & fork, 1x 2.62 feet 12V/24V power cable , 1x 2.62 feet 110V/230V power cable. Manufacturer warranty for one year from date of purchase and lifetime customer service with a response within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wmfuyvBBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PHIWILLS","source_asin":"B0BW14N2DS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-826236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW14N2DS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW14N2DS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
