window.products.push({"id":826284,"name":"Air Fryer Countertop Convection Oven Stainless steel Toaster Oven with Low-Temperature Fermentation, Dehydrate and Spray Humidify Function Bake Broil ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jz8vbBu3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROPRIETARY PURE HOT-AIR SURROUND TECHNOLOGY: Gobege convection system is very efficient, solute the problem of bottleneck of multi layers cooking unevenly. Not only does it offer an working power of 1700W with an even hot surround airflow, meaning it can fully deliver heat to each unit. So this convection oven can help you to get a ferfectly coloured and an evenly cooked results. Great for families and commercial, as it is able to fit 3 pieces of 10\" pizza, or 66 chicken wings at a time. HIGH-PERFORMANCE TRUE CONVECTION OVEN: Compared the convection oven on the market, they still hosts heating elements that produce the heat. But Gobege convection oven depends completely on inbuilt fan to force hot air as cooking sources. It tends to cook faster and more evenly than a traditional oven. Also, you can adjust the wind-speed from 1 to 35 levels. And it offers real-time temperature monitor, and able to revise it, which offers you a precision cooking. TOUCH SAFELY & HIGH-QUALITY MADE: Our countertop convection oven's inner is made from top-level 304 Stainless Steel, with corrosion-resistant features are easy to clean. Upgraded heat-resistant technology, the oven side and top keep at safe temperature when it working. Also it offers a generous space, fit 1-6 layers food at a time, (And always it depends on the volume of food, customers statistics: 6-pcs 6\" cakes, 48 tarts, 60 Macarons, 168 banana chips, 8 pieces 150g soft-Bread) SPRAY HUMIDIFY FUNCTION & ADJUSTABLE: From 68℉ to Max 660℉ adjustable, enter number to set the time and temperature. Comes with real-time temperature shows, and able to revise the temperature. It has the memory menu function that preserve max 100 types(Time, ℉, Fan-Speed). So this oven is not just for cakes, cookies, chickens, bread and roasts, etc, also fits Fermentation, Dehydrate. Another feature is spray Humidify that can crisp the outside without drying the inside of your food. PURCHASE WITH CONFIDENCE & 1-YEAR WARRANTY: Over 20,000 customers satisfied, with our amazing track record of satisfied customers, we're so confident that you'll love our convection oven. If you have any issues, please feel free to contact us, we will be happy to solute it, and our average response time is 6 hours or less. If you want some perfectly browned cookies or some evenly cooked cakes, Gobege design convection oven is what you need. Order now to lets it join your kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jz8vbBu3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gobege","source_asin":"B09MVH997Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-826284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MVH997Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MVH997Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
