window.products.push({"id":826380,"name":"4 Pack 211+ Replacement Washable Pre-Filters for Blueair Blue Pure 211+ air Purifier, Removes Pollen, Dust, Color Include Lunar Rock, Diva Blue, Dark ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811ASnw6iNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EFFECTIVE FILTEATION: Cabiclean 4 pack 211+ replacement pre-filter for Blueair Blue Pure 211 + air purifier, effectively prevents larger particles from reaching your main filter, extending its life and maintaining optimum filter performance for longer. EASY TO INSTALL: Simply remove the older and dirty fabric pre-filter and replace it. Vacuum the fabric or toss it in the washing machine whenever it needs cleaning. Dimensions: 0.5 x 6.2 x 7.5 inches. PIECES INCLUDED: Package includes 4 replacement pre-filter, 4 different color: Lunar Rock, Diva Blue, Dark Shadow, Buff Yellow. Add a splash of color to your room. PREMIUM QUALITY BUT AFFORDABLE PRICE: We deliver high-quality, durable and long-lasting replacements, allowing the filter to last longer. They are an efficient investment. In order to improve the performance of the air purifier, please replace or wash the pre-filter every 2-3 months. CUSTOMER SERVICE: We value customer service and satisfaction. If you have any problems with the filter fitting your air purifier, please contact us through our Amazon home page.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811ASnw6iNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cabiclean","source_asin":"B0B1JL1JD4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-826380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1JL1JD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1JL1JD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":826381,"name":"Exclusive Home Curtains EH8058-01 2-96G Easton Jacquard Blackout Window Curtain Panel Pair with Grommet Top, 54x96, Black Pearl, 2 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617ZmlmojBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Easton blackout Lined grommet top window curtain panels bring a luxurious look and feel to any room. The geometric pattern is sure to add a touch of fashion and richness to your window decor. These woven panels drape beautifully and are interwoven with blackout insulation provided by LightBlock and Thermax technology. These panels will block light, prevent harmful UV rays from reaching your floors and furniture, efficiently prevents cold or heat transfer from outside, will increase energy efficiency of your home, provide unparalleled privacy, and allow you to create darkness at any time of day. Perfect drapery option for anyone seeking to block daylight, take a nap, or keep sun glare off your TV. The Easton drapery is constructed with gorgeous, matte silver grommets and can be hung on your favorite curtain rod up to 1 5/8\" diameter, adding yet another touch to the richness and luxury of your decor. These window curtain panels will drape beautifully from any window that could use that perfect, finishing touch. Our curtain panels are perfect for any living room, bedroom, family room, dining room, bathroom and office. Our stylish designs will suit any window space. From the Manufacturer Amalgamated Textiles USA, Inc, is North America’s leading supplier of home textiles and ready-made drapery by delivering high fashion designs, patterns, varying textures, and colors in an “affordable luxury” quality that today’s consumers expect. From classic solids to today’s top fashion trends, you are sure to find window panels to fit any look, mood, or style to complete your home décor project. We offer an array of fabric constructions as well, including jacquards, linens, burlap, sheers, thermal/blackout, silk and faux silks, polyester and poly blends, and cotton and cotton blends. These constructions are offered in varying designs and colors including solids, prints, textures, thickness, lengths, widths, and burnouts. Like millions of customers already have, let our window coverings be the anchor of each room in your home!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617ZmlmojBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Exclusive Home Curtains","source_asin":"B09326J6RS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-826381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09326J6RS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09326J6RS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
