window.products.push({"id":826420,"name":"Turnbull Farms(TM) Industrial Pipe Curtain Rod (60 inch bar) - Multiple Sizes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LJVaywysL._AC_SL1248_.jpg","description":"Hello! Thank you for considering our industrial pipe curtain rod. We are Zachary and Jessica Turnbull and would like you to feel free to contact us if you have any questions or needs.   Built from steel and iron industrial piping these curtain rods are a fantastic mix of style and long-lasting durability. Great for modern, rustic style homes, farm houses, lofts, offices, urban, steampunk, commercial/industrial spaces, or anywhere you want a rod that will surely be a conversation starter discussion piece with your guests.   All pipe materials are thoroughly cleaned and then coated with a clear resin to maintain the natural look of the industrial pipe but also protect the metal. It also shows off the different variations in the industrial steel that makes each rod truly unique. If you are looking for different coatings, let us know. PLEASE NOTE resin coating is for regular indoor use. If you plan to mount outdoors it will have to be painted unless prefer it to develop rust. Feel free to contact us on enamel advice or if you would like a quote for us to do it for you.   Each length listed is the bar length. Overall length to the edges of wall mounts is an additional 4.5\". Distance from the wall is approximately 3.5\" and the round flange that attaches to the wall is 3 inches in diameter. Rods longer than 60\" have the additional center bracket.   Includes black mounting screws as well as drywall anchors.   If the listing isn’t exactly what you need, please let us know. We can customize just about anything to make sure you get the perfect item!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LJVaywysL._AC_SL1248_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Turnbull FarmsTM","source_asin":"B01EKNPGJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-826420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EKNPGJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EKNPGJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
