window.products.push({"id":826594,"name":"ekovana 3qt Mini Stackable Stainless Steel Pressure Cooker Steamer Insert Pans with sling handle - compatible with Instant Pot Accessories 3 quart - t","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KxNpjde1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome to ekovana! We pioneered the launch of stackable pans to further enhance your pressure cooking experience. Impress your guests, your friends and all your loved ones by cooking delicious one pot meals with this versatile pressure cooking accessory ! Your ekovana set comes with: 1.Two stackable insert pans. 2.One easy-lift interlocking handle. 3.Two interchangeable lids. 4.One instruction leaflet providing general tips and pot-in-pot recipe ideas. ekovana stackable pressure cooker inserts enable you to : Enjoy easy home cooking of healthy steamed dishes and deliver one pot meal for the entire family, be it breakfast, lunch or dinner ! Reheat food in your pressure cooker and completely eliminate the need for a microwave. Make two cheesecakes or lasagnas at the same time ! Store cooked and leftover food in the refrigerator. ekovana stackable pans pot in pot cooking tips : 1. You may choose to use either a single insert pan or both inserts, depending on your cooking needs. 2. Ensure that you add at least 1 cup of water to the main pot or liner and the individual ekovana inserts while cooking solid foods. If the recipe calls for liquid food, like sauce or curry, then you may only need to add water in the main cooking pot. 3. Food on the bottom stack will cook faster than food on the top stack. Please ensure that you have delicate food (needing less time to cook) placed in the top pan and dense food (needing more time to cook) placed in the bottom pan. For example: Pasta or noodles on the top and protein such as chicken on the bottom. Care and Cleaning: Whether you are washing your inserts by hand or in the dishwasher, it is important to dry it promptly so spotting, streaking, discoloration, or corrosion does not occur","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KxNpjde1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ekovana","source_asin":"B07771LJKZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-826594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07771LJKZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07771LJKZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
