window.products.push({"id":826860,"name":"Redrock Traditions Family Mission Statement 24 x 14 Wood Chalkboard Wall Sign Plaque","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b2AaKRvEL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Life is busy, and it’s easy to allow a day, a week, or a month go by without much real family conversation or connection. Red Rock Traditions is continuously trying to think of ways to knit family closer together, not only during planned vacations, but every day. We are often looking for solutions to make the most of our together-time and to create a bedrock of memories, shared stories, conversations and laughter. Red Rock Traditions is dedicated to strengthening the bonds of family and friends through products that are meaningful. Wall art and signs from Red Rock Collection are more than decorative as they double as reminders of what is most important, family connection. Inspired by a vintage hymn board that is ever-present. This piece invites participants to identify your family values and, together, create a mission statement that members can commit to living by during the year. You can craft your own spiritual and character goals on the blank boards or choose from the set. Bring antique charm to your decorating spaces with this home accent. Wall sign is made of medium density fiberboard, solid pine and metal. Slide chalkboard plaque cards out of beaded board holders to rearrange priorities and goals. Total dimensions of board measures 24 x 14 inches. Plaque includes both pre-printed and blank chalkboard slats, stick chalk. Chalkboard preparation: Hold a piece of chalk horizontally and rub entire surface of chalkboard. With a dry paper towel, rub in an overlapping, circular motion. Wipe chalkboard surface with a chalkboard eraser. Part of the Faith Collection for DEMDACO. Wooden marbles included in set. Ships all together within protective packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b2AaKRvEL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Redrock Traditions","source_asin":"B07H38T855","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-826860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H38T855","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H38T855","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
