window.products.push({"id":826895,"name":"GorgeousHome (MR2) BLACK 1pc Panel Curtain Faux Silk Rod Pocket Semisheer Treatment Unlined Solid Color in 3 sizes (63\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QVxQtf0sL._AC_.jpg","description":"THIS ARE PLAIN SOLID SEMI SHEER FAUX SILK WINDOW CURTAIN PANEL (NOT A BLACKOUT CURTAIN) ROD SIZE : 2\" OR LESS FITS CARE INSTRUCTIONS: * MACHINE WASHABLE *COLD WATER *GENTLE CYCLE *DO NOT BLEACH *DRY ON LOW SETTING *USE COOL IRON","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QVxQtf0sL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gorgeous Home LINEN","source_asin":"B075FFN9FM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-826895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075FFN9FM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075FFN9FM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":826896,"name":"Leather Coaster Oxcart Wheel (Red) Set of 4 with Holder Protects Furniture from Water Spills, Wine, Coffee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SnuQS72lL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"With its unique design, our colorful and fun coaster set becomes not just the perfect table/bar accessory, but also a stylish addition to your everyday life and home decor. FIVE STAR QUALITY Among our clients are several 5* Luxury Resorts and Hotels in Costa Rica, boutique travel agencies and other leaders of the travel industry. INSPIRATION Costa Rican Oxcarts are a large part of Costa Rican history. They allowed for the expansion and increase of exports of many goods including Costa Rica's main export, coffee. It also is a huge part of Costa Rican culture today. Painting and decorating oxcarts began in the early 20th century, when each region in Costa Rica began creating its own design allowing for identification when in transportation. Then, cow herders began hand-painting their own oxcarts in addition to their identification designs. Many of these paintings included bright colors, geometric figures, and even portraits of people and beautiful landscapes. In 1903, people began enhancing their oxcarts by adding designs to their wheels. In 1915, the entire wheels were painted and decorated to create a distinct look for each family. Many times these designs would show the social status of the families. Although many oxcarts are similar, no two are painted exactly the same. The art of painting these oxcarts has been passed down from generation to generation. On March 22, 1988, “La Carreta” was designated the National Labor Symbol for Costa Rica. In addition on November 24, 2005, the typical oxcart was declared Intangible Cultural Heritage by UNESCO. OUR MISSION We are more than happy to be donating 10% of our proceeds to non-profit organizations in Costa Rica that work hard in order to save rescued wild animals. These organizations focus on rehabilitating them (providing them with a safe environment, offering medical attention) and, once they have recovered completely, releasing the releasing them back into the rainforest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SnuQS72lL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUNI Costa Rica","source_asin":"B07K7ZGC5L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-826896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K7ZGC5L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K7ZGC5L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
